{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297620","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297620","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1029762001:1":{"text":"ブラックゴールド商会！？あなたたちが黒幕だったんですか！？","source_cn":"居然是黑金商会的家伙！你们就是幕后黑手吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB628B488475E2651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029762002:1":{"text":"ロワンさんに……いや、ミスリル商会に何をするつもりですか！？","source_cn":"说！黑金商会想对罗万……不，想对秘银商会做什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4B6A12A2487C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029762003:0":{"text":"ご、誤解よ、誤解！こっちも仕事でやってるんだから、命までは取らないで！","source_cn":"哎呀，别误会，别误会！大家都是出来打工的，不要赶尽杀绝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E7022C3B21AC9DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029762004:1":{"text":"仕事？つまり、あなたも依頼を受けたってことですね？","source_cn":"打工？！你是说，你也是接受委托的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x021C02DDA16D5005","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029762005:1":{"text":"そうよ。あたしらブラックゴールドは、いつだって平等で友好的な取り引きを心がけてるんだから。そんな大っぴらに、ミスリル商会の後継者に手を出すはずないでしょ……","source_cn":"是啊，我们黑金商会向来与人为善，主张平等友好的贸易关系...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46B250FA94D964CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029762005":{"text":"そうよ。あたしらブラックゴールドは、いつだって平等で友好的な取り引きを心がけてるんだから。そんな大っぴらに、ミスリル商会の後継者に手を出すはずないでしょ……","source_cn":"是啊，我们黑金商会向来与人为善，主张平等友好的贸易关系，怎么可能对秘银商会的继承人公然动手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46B250FA94D964CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029762006:1":{"text":"だから、これは個人的な依頼！商会とは関係ないんだってば！","source_cn":"但我是私下接活，私人委托，私人关系，真的不能代表商会啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04AA3B5E89B6B9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029762008:1":{"text":"このご時世、どこで働くのも楽じゃないの。これも大事なお得意さんをつなぎ止めるためなのよ……","source_cn":"唉，如今哪里工作都不好做，我也是为了维护我的大客户嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43BC96D99A8A48BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029762009:1":{"text":"お得意さん？オイラを襲うよう依頼した相手のことか？","source_cn":"你的大客户？你是说，委托你对我动手的那个人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3666C105641CDCE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029762010:0":{"text":"是的，你也知道吧，就是</style>与<style=\"highlight\">平德</style>，这一带的区域负责人。","source_cn":"是的，你也知道吧，就是<style=highlight...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x75AB5DE7CBECF4A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_ind