le_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029762016:1":{"text":"やっと見つけたお得意さんだもの。色々便宜も図ってあげたし、頑張ってつなぎ止めるのは当然でしょ？","source_cn":"他可是我好不容易拿下的大客户，给了不少方便，那我肯定也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C018011FC2767CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029762017:1":{"text":"だからこの依頼を受けたのか？具体的には何て言われたんだ？","source_cn":"所以，他这次委托你来袭击我？具体是怎么说的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FD928471324D1D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029762018:1":{"text":"ミスリル商会の若造が、調子に乗って帳簿を調べ始めて、長年仕えてきた自分たちにケチをつけようとしてるって……","source_cn":"这次他说，秘银商会乳臭未干的小少爷自以为是地查账，想对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA19249BA8EA1F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029762019:1":{"text":"あいつの思い通りになったら、今後の取り引きは全部パーになるぞって……","source_cn":"如果让这小子得逞，那以后我们的合作就全盘泡汤了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B6850C7B77D510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029762020:1":{"text":"だから、あたしもブラックゴールドのツテを使って、あんたたちが聖石町を出たあとの動向を調べたのよ……","source_cn":"所以我也用了黑金商会这边的渠道，留意了你从圣石镇离开以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3050326CD31CBBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title